stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reported
    Reported --> Acknowledged : استلام الفني
    Acknowledged --> Assessing
    Assessing --> InProgress : بدء الإصلاح
    Assessing --> WaitingApproval : يحتاج اعتماد
    WaitingApproval --> InProgress : موافقة
    WaitingApproval --> Rejected
    InProgress --> WaitingParts : قطع غيار
    WaitingParts --> InProgress : وصلت
    InProgress --> Testing
    Testing --> Closed : ناجح
    Testing --> InProgress : فاشل (إعادة)
    Rejected --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]